  <para style="h">ROM</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ñwed Mbon Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ro</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ñwed Mbon Rom</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Ñwed emi oto Pọl asañautom Jisọs Kraist, emi Abasi okokotde ete edi mbet, onyuñ adiañarede enye enim ndikwọrọ Eti Mbuk Esie. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Eti Mbuk emi Abasi ọkọñwọñọde ke anyan ini emi ekebede oto ke inua mme asiak uduak Esie, ke edisana ñwed Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Eti Mbuk emi abaña Eyen Esie, Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist ke emana obukidem, Enye akamana oto ke ubon Defid, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />emi ekenamde Enye edi Eyen Abasi oto ke odudu Edisana Spirit, ye ke ediset ke ñkpa Esie, kpa Jisọs Kraist Ọbọñ ñnyin. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Oto ke Enye ye ke ntak Enyiñ Esie, ñnyin ima ibọ mfọn ndidi mme mbet Esie ndikot kpukpru owo ke kpukpru idut esuk ibuot enọ Enye oto ke mbuọtidem. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Mbufo ñko enyuñ edu ke otu mme mmọ emi ekekotde ete mbufo edidi ikọt Jisọs Kraist, <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />anam ami ñwet ñwed nnọ esọk kpukpru mbufo emi edude ke Rom, mbufo emi Abasi amade, onyuñ okotde ete edi edidi mme ndisana ikọt Esie. Yak Abasi ete ñnyin ye Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist ọnọ mbufo mfọn ye emem.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwem Emi Otode Ke Edibuọt Idem Ye Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Ke akpa itie, mmọkọm Abasi mi ke Jisọs Kraist mbaña kpukpru mbufo, koro ofuri ererimbot ke ekop ebaña etop mbuọtidem mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Abasi, emi ndade ofuri esit mi nnam ñkpọ nnọ Enye ke ndikwọrọ Eti Mbuk Eyen Esie, edi ntiense mi, nte ami ntide mbufo <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />kpukpru ini emi mbọñde akam. Ami mbeñe nte yak Abasi ke mfọn Esie, ọnọ mi ukeme ndidi ndise mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Koro mmenyene ata udọñ ndikut mbufo, man oto do mbuana mme enọ Spirit ye mbufo, ndinam mbufo esọñ idem. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Se ami ntiñde ọwọrọ ete, ami ye mbufo ikpenyene uñwam ini kiet, ami ñnyene uñwam nto mbuọtidem mbufo, mbufo ñko enyuñ enyene uñwam eto mbuọtidem mi.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Mbufo enyene nditi emi nditọ ete mi, ete ke mmanduak ndidi ndise mbufo ke ediwak ini, edi ñkpọ ọbiọñọ mi kpukpru ini ndinam ntre. Ami ñyom ndinyene mme mmọ emi ekabarede esit ke otu mbufo ñko, kpa nte ami ñnyenede ke otu mme mmọ emi midighe ubon mme Ju. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ami mmakama kpukpru owo isọn, mbio ntatenyin ye mmọ emi midighe mbio ntatenyin, mme ọfiọk ñwed ye mme mmọ emi mifiọkke ñwed. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ke ntre ami mmokop udọñ ndikwọrọ Eti Mbuk emi ñko nnọ mbufo emi edude ke Rom.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Ami ñkopke but mbaña Eti mbuk Kraist, koro enye edide odudu Abasi ndinyaña kpukpru mmọ emi enimde ke akpanikọ, ebem iso enọ mme Ju, enyuñ enọ mme mmọ emi midighe ubon mme Ju. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Eti Mbuk emi ayarade usuñ nte Abasi anamde mme owo enen ye Enye, oto ke mbuọtidem, tọñọ ke editọñọ tutu esim utit. Nte ñwed Abasi ọdọhọde ete, “Enye emi enamde enen ye Abasi, edidu uwem oto ke mbuọtidem.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Emi Otode Ke Ntututọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Koro iyaresit Abasi ayarade oto ke enyọñ esim kpukpru mme anana ndik Abasi ye oburobut mme owo, emi edade mme oburobut ido mmọ efik akpanikọ. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Koro se mme owo ekemede ndifiok mbaña Abasi añwaña mmọ nte ọfọnde, sia Abasi ke idem esie anam añwaña. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Tọñọ, nte Abasi okobot ererimbot, nsinsi odudu Esie ye obot Esie nte Abasi, okposuk edi emi owo mikwe ke enyin, esuk ededu do enọ esit owo ndikut nto ke mme ñkpọ emi Enye akanamde. Ntak edi oro mme utọ mmọ oro minyeneke se edade enyaña idem.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Mmọ ediọñọ Abasi, edi mmọ esin ndinọ Enye ukpono emi enyenede Enye nte Abasi, mme ndinọ Enye ekọm, edi utu ke oro, ekikere esit mmọ akabade ọwọrọ ata ndisime, ndien esit mmọ emi anade ukpọk ọyọhọ ye ekim. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Okposuk edi emi mmọ edọhọde ete mmimọ idi mme ọfiọkñkpọ owo edi mmọ ekabade edi mme ndisime, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />ndien emen ubọñ Abasi emi midikpaha ke nsinsi ekpuhọ ye mbiet mme ñkpọ emi enamde ke mbiet owo emi edikpade, ye mbiet mme inuen, ye eke mme unam ikọt ye eke mme unam emi enyọnide nyọni.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ke ntak emi mmọ esimede ntem, Abasi amayak mmọ ọnọ mme idiọk udọñ esit mmọ ndika iso ke use ye mme mbiara edu uwem emi asabarede ikpọkidem mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Utu ke mmọ enim ke akpanikọ se mmọ ekediọñọde nte ke edi akpanikọ emi otukde Abasi, mmọ ekabade emek ndinim nsu ke akpanikọ. Ke ntre mmọ etuak ibuot enọ se Abasi akanamde, edi esin ndituak ibuot nnọ mfọnmma Abasi emi okobotde mme ñkpọ emi.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ke ntak emi mme owo enamde ntem, Abasi asana mmọ ayak ọnọ idiọk udọñ. Kpa ye iban mmọ, ekabade eda iferi mmọ esin ke edinam emi midighe nnen nnen. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Kpa ntre ñko irenowo inyeneke aba udọñ ndinyene ebuana ye iban, ekabade ekop ufiop ufiop udọñ ye eke mmọ irenowo. Eren owo anam ñkpọ obut ye eke mmọ eren, ndien mmọ ebọ ufen emi ekemde ye idiọk edinam mmọ.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Koro mmọ esinde ndikere ke esit mmọ mbaña ifiọk akpanikọ emi abañade Abasi, Abasi asana mmọ ayak ọnọ mbiara udọñ esit mmọ, anam mmọ enam mme ñkpọ emi mmọ mikpanamke. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Uwem mmọ ọyọhọ ye nsionsio ukwañido ye idiọk itọñ, ye usua, ye isinenyin, ye uwot owo, ye eñwan, ye nsu ye idiọkesit, ye ibaña edem. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Mmọ etiñ idiọk ikọ edian kiet eken, esua Abasi, esọñ enyin, etañ idem, ebure mbure; edi mme nta ke unam idiọkñkpọ; mmọ esọñ ibuot ye ete ye eka mmọ; <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />mmọ inyeneke ifiọk, inyeneke mbuọtidem, inyeneke ima, mme ndikop owo mbọm. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Okposuk edi nte mmọ ediọñọde ete ke mbet Abasi ọdọhọ ete, mme mmọ emi edude uwem ke utọ usuñ emi edot ñkpa, mmọ ikaha iso ndinam mme ñkpọ emi ke idem mmọ ikpọñ edi mmọ enyuñ eñwam mme mmọ efen ndinam mme ñkpọ emi ñko.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ufen Odu Ke Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ufan mi, nte afo omobiom mme mmọ efen ikpe? Ke ntem afo unyeneke se afo etiñde ndida ñnyaña idem, koro edieke afo obiomde mme mmọ efen ikpe, edi afo anam ukemukem ñkpọ oro mmọ enamde, afo omobiom idem fo ikpe. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Ñnyin imọfiọk ite ke Abasi enen ke ini Enye obiomde mme mmọ emi enamde utọ ñkpọ eke etiede ntem ikpe. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Edi afo ufan mi, emi obiomde mme mmọ emi enamde oruk ñkpọ emi ikpe, ndien afo onyuñ anam kpasuk se mmọ enamde, mme nte afo ekere ete ke imọ iyebọhọ ubiomikpe Abasi? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Mme nte afo esin uwak mfọnido, ye ime, ye ediyọ Esie ke ndek, edi ufiọkke ete ke mfọnido Abasi edi ndinam fi akabade esit?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Edi oto ke ntak nsọñibuot ye unana edikabade esit mbufo, mbufo ke ekọ iyaresit enim enọ idem mbufo ke usen iyaresit Abasi, ke ini emi ediyararede nnen nnen ubiere ikpe Esie. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Abasi eyenọ owo kiet kiet utib nte asañade ekekem ye se enye anamde. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Enye eyeyak nsinsi uwem ọnọ mmọ emi eyirede ke edinam eti ido enyuñ eyom ubọñ ye ukpono ye uwem emi midibiarake. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Edi iyaresit ye ifuresit Abasi eyetiene mme mmọ emi edide ibuk, emi esinde se inende, enyuñ etienede se idiọkde. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Ufen ye ndutuhọ eyetiene kpukpru owo emi enamde se idiọkde: eyetiene mme Ju ke akpa itie, onyuñ etiene mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju; <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />edi ubọñ ye ukpono ye emem eyetiene kpukpru owo emi enamde se ifọnde: eyetiene mme Ju ke akpa itie, ndien etiene mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Koro Abasi miteñeke baba owo ndomokiet enyin.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Kpukpru mmọ emi enamde idiọkñkpọ nte mme anana ibet, eyetak nte mme anana ibet, edi kpukpru mmọ emi enamde idiọkñkpọ ke idak ibet, eyeda ibet ekpe ikpe ye mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Koro idighe edikop ibet anam owo enen ke iso Abasi, edi edinam se ibet etemede anam owo enen ke iso Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ke akpanikọ, ke ini mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju emi minyeneke ibet, enamde ke uduak esit mmọ se ibet etemede, mmọ enam ibet enọ idem mmọ, okposuk edi emi mmọ minyeneke ibet. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Edinam mmọ owut ete ke ewet se ibet etemede esin ke esit mmọ. Esit mmọ ñko onyuñ owut nte ke emi edi ntre, sia ekikere esit mmọ ñko esibiomde mmọ ikọ ke ubak ini, ndien ke ubak ini ñko onyuñ odorode mmọ uyo. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Do nte asañade ekekem ye Eti Mbuk emi ami ñkwọrọde, emi edi nte ñkpọ editiede ke usen oro kini Abasi edikpede ikpe ke mme ndedibe ekikere esit owo ito Jisọs Kraist.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Edieke mbufo ekotde idem mbufo Ju, edieke mbufo ebuọtde idem ke ibet, enyuñ ebure mbure ebaña Abasi mbufo, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />edieke mbufo ediọñọde uduak Abasi eto ke ibet, enyuñ ekeme nditiñ se inende, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />edieke mbufo eyuhọde nte ke mmimọ imekeme ndida mme nnan usuñ, ndien enyuñ edi uñwana enọ mme mmọ emi etiede ke ekim, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />edieke mbufo ekemede ndikpep mbio ndisime ñkpọ ñnyuñ nnọ mme anana ifiọk item koro ibet mbufo esinede kpukpru ifiọk ye akpanikọ, <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />ntaha mbufo emi ekpepde mme mmọ efen mikpepke idem mbufo-e? Mbufo emi ekwọrọde ete owo ekuyip inọ, nte mbufo ñko iyipke? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Mbufo emi edọhọde ete, yak mme owo ekusin efibe, nte mbufo inyuñ isinke efibe? Mbufo emi ebatde ndem nte mbubiam ñkpọ, nte mbufo iwaha itie ukpono mmọ?<verse eid="ROM 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Mbufo emi enamde inua ebaña ibet, nte mbufo imiomke Abasi ke edibiat ibet? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ ete, “Edi ke ntak ndudue mbufo mme Ju, mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju etiñ oburobut ikọ edian enyiñ Abasi.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Edieke mbufo enimde ibet, edina mbobi mbufo enyene udori; edi edieke mbufo ebiatde ibet, etie ukem ukem nte owo ikpenimke mbufo mbobi. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Edieke owo emi minaha mbobi anamde se ibet etemede, nte Abasi ididaha enye nte ana mbobi? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Owo emi minaha mbobi ke obukidem edi enimde ibet Abasi, eyebiom mbufo ikpe okposuk edi emi mbufo enyenede ibet emi ewetdewet, enyuñ enade mbobi nte mme abiat ibet.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Owo idighe Ju edieke enye edide ke enyọñidem kpọt, edina mbobi inyuñ idighe ke edisibe ikpọkidem ikpọñ. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Baba, ata Ju edi owo ekededi emi esit esie enende ye Abasi: koro Abasi iyomke mme mmọ emi esibede ikpọkidem mmọ ke ata edina mbobi ikpọkidem, edi Enye oyom mme mmọ emi ekabarede esit. Owo ekededi emi enyenede utọ ukpuhọde oro ke uwem esie eyebọ itoro esie oto Abasi, edieke enye mibọhọ ito owo.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ufọn Edidi Owo Ju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Nso ke mme Ju eda ekan mme mbon efen? Mme nso ufọn idu ke edina mbobi? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ndidi Ju enyene ediwak ufọn. Ke akpa itie, Abasi akayak ikọ Esie ọnọ mme Ju. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Edidi didie ndien? Edieke ndusuk mmọ mikanamke akpanikọ? Nte unana edinam akpanikọ mmọ ekeme ndidi ntak emi Abasi minamke akpanikọ? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Ke akpanikọ idighe ntre! Abasi enyene ndidi anam akpanikọ, kpukpru owo ekpededi mme osu nsu. Kpa nte ewetde ke ñwed Abasi ete, “Man unen fo ọwọrọ owut idem ke kpukpru ikọ inua fo, ndien afo onyuñ akan ke kpukpru eneni emi enenide ye ikọ fo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Edi edieke oburobut ido ñnyin ayararede mfọnmma ido Abasi, nso ke ñnyin ikpenyene nditiñ? Nte ke Abasi anam edue ke ndimia ñnyin ufen? (Ami ntiñ ke edu ekikere owo). <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Idighe ntre, koro edieke Abasi mikpedighe edinen, Enye ekpekeme didie ndikpe ikpe ererimbot? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Edi edieke unana akpanikọ mi anamde Abasi enyene ubọñ ke ndinam akpanikọ Esie ọsọñọ ada onyuñ atara, nso ndien idi ntak emi esuk ebiomde mi ikpe nte anam idiọkñkpọ? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Nso idi ntak emi ñnyin midọhọke ite, “Eyak ñnyin inam idiọk man oto do ufọn edi?” Mme owo ebiat enyiñ ñnyin ke edisua nnọ ñnyin nte ke imetiñ mme utọ ikọ ntre. Mmọ eyebọ ubiomikpe emi odotde.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Nso ndien ke ñnyin ididọhọ? Nte ñnyin mme Ju imọfọn ikan mme mbon efen? Baba-o, idighe ntre, koro ñnyin ima ibebem iso iwut ite ke kpukpru owo edi mme anam idiọkñkpọ ukem ukem, edide Ju mme mmọ emi midighe Ju. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Nte ñwed Abasi etiñde ete, “Baba owo kiet emi enende iduhọ, baba owo kiet ke ofuri ererimbot emi enende iduhọ.”<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Baba owo kiet emi enyenede ifiọk iduhọ. Baba owo kiet emi oyomde Abasi iduhọ. <verse eid="ROM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Kpukpru owo ema ewọñọde ekpọñ Abasi, kpukpru mmọ enyuñ ebiara, baba owo kiet emi anamde se ifọnde iduhọ, baba ndomokiet. <verse eid="ROM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Usuñitọñ mmọ etie nte anaiñwañ udi, edeme mmọ eyọhọ ye oburobut nsu, ndien ndiọi ikọ emi ebietde ifọt urukikọt edu ke ñkpọkinua mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Inua mmọ eyọhọ ye isuñi ye ndot ndot ikọ. <verse eid="ROM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />“Ikpat mmọ esọp ndinọ unan, enyuñ esọp ndiwot. <verse eid="ROM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Mmọ ekpọñ nsobo ye ndutuhọ ke ebiet ekededi emi mmọ ekade. <verse eid="ROM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Mmọ inyuñ idiọñọke usuñ emem,” <verse eid="ROM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />“mme mmọ ndikpep nte ebakde Abasi.” <verse eid="ROM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Edi ñnyin imọdiọñọ ite se ededi emi ibet etiñde, etiñ ọnọ mmọ emi edude ke idak ibet, man oto do etre kpukpru mfaña mme owo, ndien eda ofuri ererimbot esin ke idak ikpe Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Koro idinamke owo ndomokiet enen ke iso Abasi oto ke edinim ibet; edi se ibet anamde edi ndinam owo ọfiọk ete ke imọ idi anam idiọkñkpọ.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Edi ke emi Abasi ayarade usuñ emi anamde mme owo enen ke iso Esie, usuñ emi inyeneke ñkpọ ndomokiet ndinam ye ibet. Mme ibet ye mme Asiak Uduak Abasi enyuñ edi mme ntiense enọ enye. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Abasi anam mme owo enen oto ke mbuọtidem emi mmọ enyenede ke Jisọs Kraist. Abasi anam emi ọnọ kpukpru mmọ emi enimde Kraist ke akpanikọ, koro ukpuhọde ndomo baba kiet iduhọ. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Koro kpukpru owo ema enam idiọkñkpọ, enyuñ eduọ ekpọñ ubọñ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Edi oto ke mfọn Abasi emi edide ke mfọn enam kpukpru owo enen ke iso Abasi oto ke emi Kraist anamde mmọ ebọhọ.<verse eid="ROM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Koro Abasi ọkọdọñ Kraist Jisọs edibọ ufen idiọkñkpọ ñnyin, onyuñ etre kpukpru iyaresit Abasi ye ñnyin. Enye akada iyip Kraist ye mbuọtidem ñnyin afak ñnyin osio ke iyaresit Esie. Ke usuñ emi Enye ama enen eti eti, okposuk edi emi enye mikamiaha mme mmọ emi ekenamde idiọkñkpọ ke akpa ini ufen. Koro Enye ekebet ini emi Kraist edidide ndimen mme idiọkñkpọ oro mfep. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Edi idahaemi, ke eyo emi, Enye ifumike mme idiọkñkpọ mme owo, man oto do Enye osio edinen ido Esie owut. Ke usuñ emi Abasi anam owut nte imọ ke idem imọ idi edinen ndien ke imọ inen iso ye owo ekededi emi enimde Kraist ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Nso ndien ke ñnyin ikeme nditaña ase mbaña? Ñkpọ ndomokiet iduhọ! Ndien asaña didie edi ntre? Ndi koro ñnyin inimde ibet? Baba o, edi koro ñnyin inimde ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ñnyin ikut ite ke owo enen ye Abasi oto ke mbuọtidem ikpọñ ikpọñ, idighe ndinam se ibet etemede.<verse eid="ROM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Mme nte Abasi edi Abasi mme Ju ikpọñ? Mme nte Enye inyuñ idighe Abasi mmọ emi midighe mme Ju ñko? Ke akpanikọ Enye onyuñ edi Abasi mme mmọ emi midighe Ju ñko. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Sia Abasi edide Abasi kiet, Enye eyenam mme Ju enen ye Enye oto ke udomo mbuọtidem mmọ, eyenyuñ anam mmọ emi midighe mme Ju ñko enen ye Enye oto ke mbuọtidem mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Nte emi ọwọrọ ete ñnyin inyeneke aba ndinim ibet ke ntak mbuọtidem emi? Baba-o, idighe ntre. Ke ofuri akpanikọ ñnyin ikeme ndisuk ibuot nnọ enye kadaña emi ñnyin ibuọtde idem ye Jisọs.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Uwutñkpọ Ebraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Nso ke ñnyin ididọhọ ndien ibaña Ebraham, emi edide akwa ete ñnyin? Nso ifiọk ke enye ekenyene abaña owo ndinen ye Abasi nto ke mbuọtidem? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Edieke ekpenamde enye enen ye Abasi oto ke mme ñkpọ emi enye akanamde, enye ekpenyene ntak nditaña ase, edi enye ikemeke nditaña ase ke iso Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Koro Ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ ete, Ebraham ama enim Abasi ke akpanikọ, anam oto ke ntak mbuọtidem esie, Abasi ama ada enye nte edinen owo.<verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Owo emi anamde utom ọbọ ukpe okuk, owo ibatke utib utom esie nte enọ mme ñkpọ mfọn, edi ebat nte okuk emi enye anamde utom ọbọ. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Edi owo emi minamke utom edi enyene mbuọtidem, enye emi enimde Abasi emi anamde ikpe etebe mme idiọk owo ke akpanikọ, edi mbuọtidem esie ke Abasi emen esin ke ibat, man oto do Enye anam enye enen ke iso Esie.<verse eid="ROM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Emi ke Defid ekekere, ke ini enye etiñde abaña inemesit owo emi Abasi abatde nte edinen owo, emi misañake ye utom;<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />Ọfọfọn ọnọ mme mmọ emi Abasi efende mme idiọkñkpọ mmọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">emi Enye onyuñ ofukde ndudue mmọ ofuri ofuri!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Ọfọfọn ọnọ mme mmọ emi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">Abasi mibatke aba mme idiọkñkpọ mmọ inọ mmọ.<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Nte inemesit emi Defid eketiñde enyene mmọ emi enade mbobi ikpọñ ikpọñ? Baba-o, onyuñ enyene mme mmọ emi minaha mbobi ñko. Koro ñnyin imokut ke ñwed Abasi, ite, “Ebraham ama enim Abasi ke akpanikọ, ndien ke ntak mbuọtidem esie Abasi ama enyime enye nte edinen owo.”<verse eid="ROM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Ini efe ke ñkpọ emi akada itie? Nte ekedi ke ini emi enye ama akana mbobi mme ekedi ke ini emi enye mikinaha mbobi kaña? Ekedi mbemiso enye akana mbobi, ikedighe ke ini enye ama akanana mbobi.<verse eid="ROM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ekenim enye mbobi ke Abasi ama ọkọñwọñwọñọ ndidiọñ enye, ke ntak mbuọtidem emi Ebraham ekenyenede. Abasi ama abat enye nte edinen owo mbemiso enye ana mbobi. Ke ntre Ebraham edi ete ke Spirit ọnọ kpukpru mmọ emi enimde Abasi ke akpanikọ, emi Enye onyuñ abatde nte mme ndinen owo, okposuk edi emi mmọ minaha mbobi. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Enye onyuñ edi ete mme mmọ emi enade mbobi ñko, idighe ke ntak emi mmọ enade mbobi, edi koro mmọ edude ukem ukem uwem mbuọtidem emi ete ñnyin Ebraham okodude mbemiso enye ana mbobi.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Abasi ama ọñwọñọ ọnọ Ebraham ye ubon esie ete ke ofuri ererimbot edinyene enye idighe koro Ebraham ekenimde ibet akanam Abasi anam eñwọñọ emi, edi koro enye ama enim ke akpanikọ anam Abasi ama abat enye nte edinen owo. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Koro edieke eñwọñọ emi Abasi ọñwọñọde ekpenyenede mme mmọ emi enimde ibet, mbuọtidem emi owo enyenede ọkpọwọrọ ikpuikpu, mme eñwọñọ Abasi ñko ikpenyeneke udori. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Ibet ada iyaresit Abasi edi; edi ebiet ekededi emi ibet miduhọ edibiat ibet ñko inyuñ iduhọ.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Eñwọñọ emi okodoro ke mbuọtidem, man oto do eñwọñọ emi enyene uwem nte enọ emi Abasi ọnọde ubon Ebraham ke mfọn, idighe mme mmọ emi enimde ibet ikpọñ, edi ye mme mmọ emi enimde ke akpanikọ nte Ebraham ekenimde. Koro Ebraham edide ete ke Spirit ọnọ kpukpru owo; <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />nte ñwed Abasi etiñde ete, “Ami mmanam fi edi ete ediwak mme idut.” Ke ntre eñwọñọ emi ọfọn ke enyin Abasi, emi Ebraham ekenimde ke akpanikọ, Abasi emi anamde mme akpa ñkpa edu uwem, emi uyo ewuhọ Esie anamde se mikeduhọ edu.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ebraham ama enim ke akpanikọ onyuñ enyene idorenyin ke idem ini emi idorenyin mikeduhọ anam oto ke ntak oro enye ama edi, “Ete ediwak mme idut.” Ukem nte ñwed Abasi ọdọhọde ete, “Ubon fo ediwak ntem.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Enye ekedi ñkpọ nte owo isua ikie, edi mbuọtidem esie ikememke ke ini enye ekekerede ikpọkidem esiemọ, emi ama akakpa ama, ye nte Sera ekebede isua uman eyen.<verse eid="ROM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Mbuọtidem esie ikekpọñke enye, ndien enye ikenyuñ iyikke eñwọñọ Abasi; mbuọtidem esie ama ọyọhọ enye ye odudu, ndien enye ama ọnọ Abasi ekọm. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Enye ama eneñede enim ke akpanikọ ete ke Abasi ekeme ndinam se Enye ọkọñwọñọde. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Emi edi ntak emi Abasi akabatde Ebraham nte edinen owo oto ke mbuọtidem esie.<verse eid="ROM 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Ikọ emi edọhọde ete, “Ema enyime enye nte edinen,” ikewetke inọ enye ikpọñ, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />edi ekewet ñko enọ ñnyin emi edibatde nte mme ndinen, emi ibuọtde idem ye Enyemi akanamde Jisọs Ọbọñ ñnyin eset ke ñkpa. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Ema eyak Enye enọ ñkpa kabaña mme idiọkñkpọ ñnyin, ndien ema enam Enye eset man enam ñnyin inen ke iso Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Emem Ye Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Mmọdo sia ema ekenam ñnyin inen ke iso Abasi oto ke mbuọtidem, ñnyin imenyene emem ye Abasi oto ke Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Koro ke ntak mbuọtidem, Enye ama ada ñnyin oduk ke akwa itie mfọn Abasi emi ñnyin idude ke esit idahaemi, ndien ñnyin imadara ke idorenyin edibuana ubọñ Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ñnyin inyuñ idara ñko ke mme afanikọñ ñnyin, koro ñnyin imọfiọk ite ke afanikọñ aman ime, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />ndien ime ada unyime Abasi edi, ndien unyime Esie anam idorenyin odu. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Ndien idorenyin emi idikpuhu ñnyin, koro Abasi ama añwaña ima Esie esin ke esit ñnyin oto ke Edisana Spirit emi Enye ọkọnọde ñnyin.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Koro ke idem ini emi ñnyin ikedide mmeme, ke ekem ini Abasi, Kraist amakpa ke ibuot mme idiọk owo. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ke akpanikọ edi ata ọkpọsọñ ñkpọ owo ndikpa ke ibuot edinen owo okposuk edi oro owo ekeme ndinyime ndikpa ke ibuot eti owo. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Edi Abasi etim ayarade owut ñnyin, utọ akwa ima emi enye amade ñnyin; ekedi ke idem ini emi ñnyin ikosuk idide mme anam idiọk, ke Kraist akakpa ọnọ ñnyin. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Oto ke ñkpa Esie enam ñnyin inen ye Abasi, nte Enye eyekpu ndifak ñnyin nsio ke iyaresit Abasi? <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ñnyin ikedi mme asua Abasi, edi enye ama anam ñnyin idi mme ufan Esie oto ke ñkpa Eyen Esie. Ke emi ñnyin ima ikedi mme ufan Esie, ñnyin imenyene idorenyin edinyaña oto ke uwem Eyen Esie. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Edi ikureke ke oro, ñnyin imadara ke Abasi, ito Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist, emi otode ke Enye ñnyin inyene emem ye Abasi idahaemi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Edomo Adam Ye Kraist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Kpa nte idiọkñkpọ okotode owo kiet oduk ererimbot, ndien ñkpa onyuñ oto ke idiọkñkpọ oro oduk, kpa ke usuñ emi ñkpa ama ebe esim kpukpru owo, koro kpukpru owo ema enam idiọkñkpọ. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Koro idiọkñkpọ ama ododu ke ererimbot mbemiso enọ ibet; edi ke ibet miduhọ, edibiat ibet idiọkñkpọ iduhọ. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Edi ñkpa ama ada ubọñ ọtọñọde ke ini Adam tutu esim ini Moses, tutu esim idem mme mmọ emi mikanamke mbiet idiọkñkpọ emi Adam akanamde, ke ndineni uyo Abasi. Adam ekedi mbiet owo emi ekenyenede ndidi. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Edi mmọ mbiba idighe ukem ukem, koro enọ mfọn Abasi itiene nte idiọkñkpọ Adam. Edi akpanikọ, nte ke idiọkñkpọ owo kiet emi ama ada ñkpa ọsọk ata ediwak owo. Edi mfọn Abasi etim okpon akan, kpa ntre ñko ye enọ mfọn Esie emi Enye ọnọde ediwak owo oto ke mfọn owo kiet emi, Jisọs Kraist.<verse eid="ROM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Idiọkñkpọ Adam kiet akada isop ñkpa ọsọk ediwak owo, ke ini Kraist emende kpukpru mme idiọkñkpọ efep ke mfọn, onyuñ ọnọ mfọnmma uwem ke itie mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Edi akpanikọ, nte ke okoto ke idiọkñkpọ owo kiet, ñkpa ọtọñọ ndida ubọñ, ke ntak owo kiet oro. Edi se owo kiet emi, Jisọs Kraist anamde okpon akan. Kpukpru mmọ emi ebọde uwak mfọn Abasi ye enọ edisana ido Esie ke mfọn eyekara ke uwem eto Kraist. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Kpa nte okotode ke idiọkñkpọ owo kiet, ebiom kpukpru owo ikpe, kpa ntre ñko oto ke utom edinen ido kiet, enam kpukpru owo ebọhọ, enyuñ enọ mmọ uwem. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Koro nte ekedade nsọñibuot owo kiet enam ediwak owo ekabade edi mme anam idiọkñkpọ kpa ntre ñko eyeto ke nsukibuot owo kiet, ediwak owo enen iso ye Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ekenọ ibet man otodo ndudue awak, edi ebiet emi idiọkñkpọ awakde, do ke mfọn Abasi etetim awak akan. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Nte idiọkñkpọ adade ubọñ ke ñkpa, kpa ntre ñko ke mfọn Abasi ada ubọñ oto ke edinen ido, emi adade ñnyin usuñ esim nsinsi uwem emi otode Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ewuri Odudu Idiọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Nso ke ñnyin iditiñ ndien? Nte ñnyin ikposuk ika iso iyire ndinam idiọkñkpọ man mfọn Abasi etetim awak? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Inaha edi ntre. Ñnyin ima ikpa inọ idiọkñkpọ, didie ndien ke ñnyin ikposuk ika iso idu uwem ke esit? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Koro ke akpanikọ mbufo emefiọk emi ete, ke ini ñnyin ikanade babtisim iduk ke ebuana ye Kraist Jisọs, ñnyin ikana babtisim iduk ke ebuana ñkpa Esie. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Ke edina babtisim ema ebuk ñnyin ye Enye, ndien ñnyin ima ibuana ke ñkpa Esie, man otodo, kpa nte ekemenerede Kraist esio ke ñkpa oto ke utibe odudu Ete, kpa ntre ñko ñnyin ikpodu obufa uwem.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Koro edieke ñnyin idide kiet ye Enye ke mbiet ñkpa Esie, ke ukem usuñ oro ke ñnyin ididi kiet ye Enye ke mbiet ediset Esie. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Ñnyin imọfiọk ite ke emekọñ akani owo emi ñnyin ikedide edian ke etoñkpa ye Kraist, man ebiat odudu idiọkñkpọ ke ikpọkidem ñnyin, man otodo ñnyin ikudi aba ifin inọ idiọkñkpọ. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Koro ke ini owo akpade enam enye ọbọhọ odudu idiọkñkpọ. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Ndien edieke ñnyin ikpade ye Kraist, ñnyin imenim ke akpanikọ ite ke ñnyin iyedu uwem ye Enye. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Koro ñnyin imọfiọk ite ke Kraist ama eset ke ñkpa, Enye idikpaha aba, ñkpa inyeneke odudu aba ke idem Esie. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Koro ñkpa emi Enye akakpade, Enye akakpa ọnọ idiọkñkpọ, okonyuñ edi ini kiet kpọt, uwem emi Enye odude idahaemi, Enye odu ọnọ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Kpa ke ukem usuñ oro, mbufo enyene ndibat idem mbufo nte mme mmọ emi ekpade enọ idiọkñkpọ edi edude uwem enọ Abasi, ke ebuana ye Kraist Jisọs.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ekuyak idiọkñkpọ ada ubọñ aba ke ikpọkidem mbufo emi edikpade emi akpanamde mbufo esuk ibuot enọ mme idiọk udọñ obukidem mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ekuyak ndido idem mbufo ndomokiet enọ idiọkñkpọ, nte ñkpọ utom oburobut ido, edi ekam eyak idem mbufo enọ Abasi nte mme mmọ emi ema ekewọñọ ke ñkpa eduk ke uwem; ndien eyak ofuri mbak ikpọkidem mbufo enọ Enye nte ñkpọ utom edinen ido. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Idiọkñkpọ inyeneke aba ndikara mbufo, koro mbufo idughe aba ke idak ibet, edi edu ke idak mfọn Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Nso efen? Nte ana ñnyin inam idiọkñkpọ sia ñnyin miduhọ aba ke idak ibet edi idude ke idak mfọn Abasi? Ñwaña nsa o!<verse eid="ROM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ke akpanikọ mbufo emefiọk ete ke ini mbufo eyakde idem mbufo enọ owo nte ofin, ndisuk ibuot nnọ enye, mbufo edi ofin eteufọk emi mbufo esukde ibuot enọ ke akpanikọ, mme ndisuk ibuot nnọ idiọkñkpọ emi ọsuñọde ke ñkpa, mme ndisuk ibuot nnọ Abasi, emi edinamde ñnyin inen ke iso Esie. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Edi yak ekọm enyene Abasi, koro okposuk edi emi mbufo ekedide ifin enọ idiọkñkpọ emekabade esuk ibuot ke ofuri esit mbufo enọ akpanikọ emi odude ke ukpepñkpọ emi mbufo ekebọde. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ema esioño mbufo ke ufin idiọkñkpọ ndien mbufo emekabade edi ifin edinen ido.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ntiñ nte owo ekpetiñde ikọ, ke ntak mmemidem mbufo ke obukidem. Kpa nte mbufo ekeyakde ofuri idem mbufo enọ nte ofin mbubiam ido, ye oburobut ido, ke ndida nnam ukwañ ido, ke ukem usuñ oro mbufo enyene ndiyak ofuri idem mbufo nte ifin edinen ido, nnọ ke ndida nnam se isanade.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Kini emi mbufo ekedide ifin idiọkñkpọ, mbufo ikọduhọ ke idak ukara edinen ido. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Nso idi udori mbufo ke ndinam mme ñkpọ oro mbufo ekopde but idahaemi? Utit mme ñkpọ emi edi ñkpa. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Edi ke emi, ema enam mbufo ewọñọ ke ufin idiọkñkpọ, emenyuñ ekabade edi ifin Abasi; ndien udori emi Enye ọnọde mbufo edi edisana uwem ye nsinsi uwem. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Koro ñkpọ eyenutom idiọkñkpọ edi ñkpa, edi enọ mfọn Abasi edi nsinsi uwem ke Kraist Jisọs Ọbọñ ñnyin.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Uwọrọ Ufin Ibet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Mbufo emefiọk se ami ñyomde nditiñ mbaña nditọ ete, koro kpukpru mbufo emenyene ifiọk ebaña ibet. Ibet akara owo kadaña ini emi enye odude uwem. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Yak nnam uwutñkpọ nnọ mbufo, ke ini eyen añwan ọdọde ebe, ibet ndọ ọbọp enye adian ye ebe esie kadaña emi ebe esie odude uwem. Edi edieke ebe esie akpade, enye ọwọrọ ufin ibet emi ọbọpde enye adian ye ebe esie. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ke ntem edieke enye ọdọde owo efen ke ini ebe esie osuk odude ke uwem, enyene ndikot enye esin efibe; edi edieke ebe esie akpade enye ọwọrọ ufin ibet, ndien edieke enye ọdọde owo efen, enye idighe aba esin efibe.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Mmọdo nditọ ete, nte onyuñ edide ye mbufo edi oro. Mbufo ñko ema ekpaña, ke ñkañ ibet, koro mbufo edi ndido ke ikpọkidem Kraist; ndien idahaemi mbufo eyedi Esie, kpa Enye emi ekesetde ke ñkpa, man ñnyin ikposioño nti mfri inọ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Koro ke ini ñnyin ikodude uwem ñnyin nte obukidem ñnyin okoyomde, mme idiọk udọñ idiọkñkpọ emi etode ke ibet ekenam utom ke idem ñnyin, ndien ñnyin ikosioño mfri ñkpa. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Edi ke emi, ñnyin imọwọrọ ke ufin ibet, koro ñnyin ikakpa kabaña mme ñkpọ oro ekesinde ñnyin ke ufin. Ñnyin inamke ñkpọ aba itiene akani usuñ ediwewet ibet, edi inam ke obufa usuñ Spirit.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Nso ke ñnyin ikpetiñ ndien? Mme nte ibet ke idem esie edi idiọkñkpọ? Baba, idighe ntre, koro ekedi ibet akanam mi ndiọñọ se idiọkñkpọ edide. Ami ñkpọdiọñọke se edisin esit ke ñkpọ owo ọwọrọde, edieke ibet mikpetiñke, ete, “Kusin esit ke ñkpọ owo.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Edi idiọkñkpọ asaña ke idak ibet enyene ifet ndinam esit mi ọyọhọ ye kpukpru oruk idiọkitọñ, koro idiọkñkpọ inyeneke uwem, ke ibet miduhọ.<verse eid="ROM 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Enyene ini emi ami ñkodude uwem unana ibet; edi ke ini emi ibet ama ekedi, idiọkñkpọ akabade edi oduuwem ñkpọ, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />ndien ami ñkpa. Ndien ibet emi akanade nte ada uwem edi, akabade ada ñkpa edi. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Koro idiọkñkpọ asaña ke ibet okut ifet abiaña mi; ndien oto ke ibet, idiọkñkpọ ndien emen mi esin ke ñkpa. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ke ntem, ibet ke idem esie edi edisana, ewuhọ onyuñ asana, enen onyuñ ọfọn.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Mme nte emi ọwọrọ ete, se ifọnde akabade ada ñkpa ọsọk mi? Idighe ntre, edi ekedi idiọkñkpọ akada ñkpa ọsọk mi; ke edidibe ke se ifọnde, idiọkñkpọ ama ada ñkpa ọsọk mi man oto do eyararede se idiọkñkpọ edide ke akpanikọ; ndien oto ke ibet eyararede ewut ete ke idiọkñkpọ edi oburobut ñkpọ. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ke ntem, ibet ọfọn edi akam edi ami ñnyene mfina, ke ntak ekenyamde mi nte ofin ke idak idiọkñkpọ.<verse eid="ROM 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Mme ido mi itimke iñwaña mi, koro ami nnamke se ami ñkpamade ndinam, utu ke oro ami ñkabade nnam se nsuade <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ke ini ami nnamde se ami meñkeyomke ndinam, emi owut ete ami menyime nte ibet enen. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ke ntre idighe aba ami nnam mme ñkpọ emi, akam edi idiọkñkpọ emi oduñde mi ke idem anam.<verse eid="ROM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ami mọfiọk nte baba eti ñkpọ ndomokiet iduhọ ke idem mi; oro edi, ke obukidem mi. Koro okposuk edi emi udọñ edinam eti ñkpọ odude mi ke idem, ukeme edinam iduhọ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Koro ami nnamke eti ñkpọ emi ọdọñde mi ndinam; utu ke oro, ami nnam idiọkñkpọ emi midọñke mi ndinam. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Edieke ami nnamde se midọñke mi ndinam, oro ọwọrọ ete idighe aba ami nnam ñkpọ akam edi idiọkñkpọ emi oduñde mi ke idem anam ñkpọ oro.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Anam, ami ñkut nte ke ibet ke ananam utom: koro ke ini emi ami ñyomde ndinam se ifọnde, se idiọkde enyene ndidi se ami mmekde. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Idara odu ke ọwọñesit mi abaña ibet Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Edi ami ñkut ibet efen anamde utom ke idem mi, ibet enyemi añwanade ye ibet enyemi esit mi enyimede. Enye anam mi ndi owo ñkpọkọbi nnọ ibet idiọkñkpọ emi anamde utom ke idem mi. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Nso utọ owo unana inemesit ke ami ndi! Anie owo edinyaña mi isio ke ikpọkidem emi adade mi aka ñkpa? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Yak ekọm enyene Abasi, emi afakde mi oto ke Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist! Ke editim ntiñ, emi edi se itibede ye ami: ke idem mi, ami ñkeme ndisuk ibuot nnọ ibet Abasi ke ekikere mi, kadaña emi obot mi nte owo osukde ibuot ọnọ ibet idiọkñkpọ.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Ubiomikpe iduhọ ke emi inọ mme mmọ emi edude ke ebuana ye Kraist Jisọs. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Koro ibet Spirit, emi adade uwem ebuana ye Kraist Jisọs ọsọk ñnyin, ama anam mi mbọhọ ibet idiọkñkpọ ye ñkpa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Se ibet mikemeke ndinam, koro obukidem ememde, Abasi ama anam ke emi Enye okosiode Eyen Esie ọdọñ ke mbiet obukidem idiọkñkpọ man Enye edi uwa usio isop idiọkñkpọ. Ndien obiom idiọkñkpọ ikpe, ke idem anam idiọkñkpọ. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Abasi akanam ñkpọ emi, man ñnyin emi idude uwem nte Spirit oyomde, emi miduhọ uwem nte obukidem oyomde, ikpanam edinen ido ibet ọyọhọ ọyọhọ <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Mme mmọ emi edude uwem nte obot idiọkñkpọ mmọ ọdọhọde mmọ edu, edi se obukidem oyomde ada ukara ke esit mmọ. Edi mmọ emi edude uwem nte Spirit ọdọhọde mmọ edu, esin esit mmọ ke se Spirit oyomde.<verse eid="ROM 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Ke ndiyak obot idiọkñkpọ akara esit fo ada ñkpa edi; ke ndiyak Spirit akara esit fo ada uwem ye emem edi. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Ke ntre owo akabade edi asua ye Abasi, kini obot idiọkñkpọ akarade esit; koro enye minimke ibet Abasi ndien ke ata akpanikọ enye ikemeke ndinim ibet Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Mme mmọ emi edide obot idiọkñkpọ akara esit mmọ ikemeke ndinem Abasi esit.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukara Obufa Obot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Edi mbufo iduhọ uwem nte obot idiọkñkpọ ọdọhọde mbufo edu, edu uwem nte Spirit ọdọhọde mbufo edu, edieke, ke akpanikọ, Spirit Abasi odude mbufo ke idem. Owo ekededi emi minyeneke Spirit Kraist idighe eke Kraist. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Edi edieke Kraist odude ke idem mbufo, okposuk edi emi ikpọkidem mbufo edikpade oto ke ntak idiọkñkpọ, Spirit mbufo eyedu uwem koro Kraist anamde mbufo enen ke iso Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ndien edieke Spirit Abasi, emi akanamde Jisọs eset ke ñkpa, oduñde mbufo ke idem, Enye emi akanamde Kraist eset ke ñkpa eyenyuñ ọnọ uwem ke ikpọkidem mbufo emi edikpade oto ke Spirit Esie emi oduñde ke idem mbufo.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Ke ntre, nditọ ete mi, ñnyin idi mme akama isọn, edi ñnyin ikamake obukidem isọn ndidu uwem nte obot idiọkñkpọ oyomde. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Koro edieke mbufo edude uwem nte obot idiọkñkpọ oyomde, mbufo eyekpa, edieke mbufo edade Spirit ewot idiọk ubọkutom obot idiọkñkpọ mbufo, mbufo eyedu uwem. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Koro kpukpru mmọ emi Spirit Abasi adade usuñ, edi mmọ edi nditọ Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Koro Spirit emi Abasi ọkọnọde mbufo ikanamke mbufo edi ifin, emi akpanamde mbufo ekop ndik, utu ke oro, Spirit akam anam mbufo edi nditọ, emi otode ke odudu Spirit ñnyin ifiori ite, “Ete, Ete.” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Spirit Abasi ke idem Esie adiana ye Spirit ñnyin, ndidi ntiense nte ke ñnyin idi nditọ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Ndien sia ñnyin idide nditọ Esie, ñnyin iyenyene udeme ke edidiọñ emi Enye enimde ọnọ ikọt Esie; ndien ñnyin ñko iyenyene udeme ye Kraist ke se Abasi ekenimde ọnọ Enye, koro edieke ñnyin ibuanade ke ukut Kraist, ñnyin ñko iyenyene udeme ke ubọñ Esie.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Edi ami mmekere nte, ke ufen emi ñnyin ibọde idahaemi, idighe se ekemede ndida ndomo ye ubọñ emi ediyararede inọ ñnyin. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Koro kpukpru se Abasi obotde etie ke ọkpọsọñ udọñ, ebet ini emi Abasi ediyararede nditọ Esie. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Koro ema ebiom ofuri ekondo ikpe, mmọ enyuñ ekabade edi ikpuikpu ñkpọ, idighe ke edinyime esie, edi koro Abasi enyimede edi ntre. Kpa ye oro idorenyin emi ama odu, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />nte ke usen kiet eyefak ofuri ekondo esio ke itie ufin ye mbiara esie, ndien esin enye ke itie eyenisọñ, ndibuana ke ubọñ emi enyenede nditọ Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Koro ñnyin imọfiọk ite tutu esim idahaemi ofuri ekondo ke emum mmum ke ubiak, nte ubiak ini uman. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Edi idighe ofuri ekondo ikpọñ, kpa ye ñnyin emi inyenede Spirit nte akpa enọ mfọn Abasi, ke inyuñ imum mmum ke esit idem ñnyin, kadaña emi ñnyin ikade iso nditie mbet Abasi ndinam ñnyin idi nditọ Esie, ndien afak ofuri ikpọkidem ñnyin.<verse eid="ROM 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Koro ekenyaña ñnyin eto ke idorenyin emi. Edi idorenyin emi ekutde ke enyin idighe idorenyin ke baba usuñ kiet. Anie edori enyin ke se enye ama okokokut? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Edi edieke ñnyin idoride enyin ke ñkpọ emi ñnyin mikwe, ñnyin iyebet ñkpọ oro ke ime.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ndien kpa ke ukem usuñ emi, ke Spirit añwam ñnyin ke mmemidem ñnyin. Koro ñnyin mifiọkke nte ñnyin ikpọbọñde akam, edi Spirit ke idem esie ekpe Abasi ubọk ọnọ ñnyin, ke mmum emi ikọ inua mikemeke nditiñ. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Ndien Abasi emi okutde esit mme owo, ọdiọñọ se ekikere Spirit edide, koro Spirit anamde ñkpeubọk ọnọ ikọt Abasi, nte ekemde ye uduak Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Ñnyin imọfiọk ite ke kpukpru ñkpọ, Abasi anam utom ke ufọn mmọ emi emade Enye, mme mmọ emi Enye okotde nte ekemde ye uduak Esie.<verse eid="ROM 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Koro mme mmọ emi Abasi ekebemde iso emek, Enye ama ọkpọnọde mmọ ñko enim ndinyene mbiet Eyen Esie, man Eyen Esie ekpedi akpa Eyen ke otu ediwak nditọ ete eken. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ndien ke ntre Abasi adianade mme mmọ emi Enye okotde enim; ndien mme mmọ emi Enye okotde ke Enye anam enen ye Enye; ndien mme mmọ emi Enye anamde enen ye Enye, ke Enye, abuana ubọñ Esie ye mmọ.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Nso ndien ke ñnyin ikeme nditiñ? Edieke Abasi adade ye ñnyin, anie ekeme ndibiọñọ ñnyin? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Enye emi mikedipke Eyen Esie, edi akawade enye ọnọ kpukpru owo, didie ke Enye ekpetre ndidian kpukpru ñkpọ ke Enye nnọ ñnyin ke ntat ubọk! <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Anie owo edidori mme ndimek ikọt Abasi ikọ? Edi Abasi anam ikpe etebe mmọ.<verse eid="ROM 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Nte owo ndomokiet ekeme ndibiom mmọ ikpe? Kraist Jisọs edi Enyemi akakpade, ke editim ntiñ, Enye emi ekesetde ke ñkpa, etie ke ubọk nnasia Abasi, ndikpe Abasi ubọk ke ibuot ñnyin. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Anie ndien ekeme ndidiañade ñnyin ke ima Kraist? Nte afanikọñ ekeme ndidiañade ñnyin, mme nsọñọ ñkpọ, mme ukọbọ, mme biọñ, mme unana, mme ñkpọ ndik, mme ñkpa?<verse eid="ROM 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Nte ñwed Abasi etiñde ete, “Ñnyin idu ke ndik ñkpa kpukpru usen oto ke ntak mbufo; ebat ñnyin nte mme erọñ emi eyomde ndiwot.” <verse eid="ROM 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Baba, edi ke kpukpru mme ñkpọ emi, ñnyin imeneñede itim inyene edikan oto ke Enye emi akamade ñnyin. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Koro mmetim nnim ke akpanikọ nte ñkpọ ndomokiet ikemeke ndidiañade ñnyin ke ima Esie. Ñkpa mme uwem, mme mme enjel, ye mme mbọñ, mme odudu, mme mme ñkpọ emi edude idahaemi, mme mme ñkpọ emi edidide, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />mme ererimbot emi odude ke enyọñ, mme ererimbot enye emi odude ke isọñ, ñkpọ ndomokiet iduhọ ke kpukpru se ebotde, emi edikemede ndidiañade ñnyin ke ima. Abasi, emi edide eke ñnyin, oto Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Akpa Nditọ Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Se ami ntiñde edi akpanikọ, ntiñ koro ami ndi eke Kraist, anam nsuhu nsu. Esit mi emi edisana Spirit akarade ọsọñọ ete ke ami nsuhu nsu. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Ami mmenyene akamba mfuhọ, ye ubiak emi midoboke ke esit mi, abaña ikọt mi, ikpọkidem mi, ye iyip mi. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Ke ntak mmọ ami ñkpama ndidu ke idak isuñi Abasi, ndien ediañade mi ye Kraist. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Mmọ edi mme mmọ emi Abasi ekemekde, Enye ama anam mmọ edi mme nditọ Esie onyuñ abuana ubọñ Esie ye mmọ. Enye ama anam ediomi ye mmọ onyuñ ọnọ mmọ ibet, mmọ enyene ata ntuak ibuot akpanikọ, enyuñ ebọ mme eñwọñọ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Mmọ eto ke ubon mme akpa ete emi ekekponode Abasi ndien Kraist okoto ke oruk mmọ ke obukidem. Yak Abasi emi akarade kpukpru ñkpọ, ọbọ itoro ke nsinsi. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Edi ami ndọhọke nte ke eñwọñọ Abasi okpu, koro idighe kpukpru nditọ Isrel edi mme mmọ emi Abasi emekde, <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />mme kpukpru se itode ubon Ebraham edi nditọ Abasi. Abasi ama ọdọhọ Ebraham ete, “Eyebat ubon Aisik nte okuo.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Emi ọwọrọ ete nditọ emi emanade ke usuñ obukidem, idighe nditọ Abasi, utu ke oro, nditọ emi emanade eto eñwọñọ Abasi, ke eda, nte ata ubon.<verse eid="ROM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Koro emi edi ikọ eñwọñọ emi Abasi ọkọñwọñọde ete, “Ami ñyefiak ndi ke ini emi Ami ñkenimde ndien Sera eyenyene eyen eren.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ikureke ke oro. Koro nditọ Ribeka mbiba ekedi ete kiet, kpa ete ñnyin Aisik. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ndien ke ini nditọ iba emi mikemanake kaña, mikonyuñ inamke idiọkñkpọ ndomokiet mme eti, man uduak Abasi nte asañade ekekem ye edimek ọkpọsọñọ ada; <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />idighe ke utom; edi oto enye emi okotde, ema edọhọ Ribeka ete, “Akpan eyenuhọ ọnọ udọ.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Nte ñwed Abasi ọdọhọde ete, “Ami ñkama Jekọb, edi Ami ñkasua Isọ.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Nso ke ñnyin ididọhọ ndien? Nte Abasi inenke ke edinam Esie? Nsa ñnyin-o! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Koro Enye ama ọdọhọ Moses ete, “Ami ñyenyene mbọm nnọ owo emi mmade, ñyenyuñ ntua owo emi mmade mbọm.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Mmọdo ñkpọ emi inaha ke se owo oyomde, mme ke se owo anamde, edi oto ke mbọm Abasi ikpọñ.<verse eid="ROM 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Koro ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ Fero ete, “Ami ñkenim fi edi edidem kpa ke ntak emi, ndida fi ñwut odudu mi, ndinyuñ nnam ofuri ererimbot ediọñọ Enyiñ Mi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ntre ke Abasi enyene mbọm ye owo emi Enye amade, onyuñ ọsọñ esit ye owo emi enye amade ndisọñ esit. <verse eid="ROM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Owo mbufo kiet eyedọhọ mi ete, “Edieke emi edide ntre, Abasi ekeme didie ndikut ndudue ke idem owo? Anie ekeme ndiñwana ye uduak Abasi?”<verse eid="ROM 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Edi afo edi anie ufan mi, emi ekemede ndiduñọde Abasi? Esio mbat ikemeke ndibup andibot enye ete, “Ntaha emi afo obotde mi ntem-e?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Owo emi obotde esio enyene unen ndinam ye mbat emi enye adade obot esio nte enye amade, ke ndibot utọ esio iba ke ukem ebok mbat kiet oro, obot kiet ọnọ ndikama ke ini akpan ñkpọ, ndien enye eken ọnọ ini ekededi. <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Emi edi ukem se Abasi akanamde. Enye okoyom ndiwut iyaresit Esie ñnyuñ nnam ediọñọ odudu Esie. Ke ntre Enye ama enyene ata ime ke ediyọ mme mmọ emi ekedide ntak iyaresit Esie, emi akanade nte esobo. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Ndien enye okoyom ñko ndiyarade uwak ubọñ Esie, emi Enye akañwañade ọnọ ñnyin emi idide mme ñkpọ mbọm Esie, mme ñnyin oro Enye ama eketim ñnyin idem ndinọ ubọñ Esie. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Koro ñnyin idi mme mmọ emi Enye okokotde, idighe ke otu mme Ju ikpọñ, edi ke otu mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju ñko.<verse eid="ROM 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Emi edi se Enye eketiñde ke ñwed Osia, ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Mme mmọ emi midighe okim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Ami ñyekot mmọ ‘ikọt mi.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Idut emi Ami meñkamaha, Ami ñyekot ‘Edima Mi.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Ndien</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">“ke idem ebiet emi ekedọhọde mmọ, ete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">Mbufo idighe ikọt mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">kpa do ke edikot mmọ nditọ oduuwem Abasi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Edi Aisaya ofiori abaña Isrel ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">“Okposuk edi nditọ Isrel ewakde nte ntan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">emi odude ke mben inyañ, ke otu oro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">esisit ibat ñyọhọnsuhọ ke edinyaña;<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Koro Ọbọñ eyesọp ndinam ọyọhọ ibat Esie ye ofuri ererimbot.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Edi ukem nte Aisaya ekebemde iso etiñ ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Edieke Jihofa Abasi mikpeyakke ubon ñnyin ọsuhọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">ñnyin ikpakabade itie nte Sọdọm, inyuñ ibiet Komora.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Nso ke ñnyin ikpetiñ ndien? Nte mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju emi mikañwanake ndinam idem mmọ enen ke iso Abasi, ema enen ke iso Abasi oto ke mbuọtidem? <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Ke ini mme ndimek ikọt Abasi emi ekeyomde ibet emi edinamde mmọ enen ye Abasi, ikekwe ibet oro. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Ndien ntak ekedide ntre-e? Koro se mmọ ekenamde ikodoroke ke mbuọtidem edi okodoro ke utom. Mmọ eketuak ukot eduọ ke “Itiat utuak ukot,” <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />emi ñwed Abasi etiñde abaña ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Sese, Ami mmenim itiat ke Sayọn, itiat emi edinamde mme owo etuak ukot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ye itiat emi edinamde mmọ eduọñọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">edi owo eke ọbuọtde idem ye Enye idikwe but.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ndinim Ke Akpanikọ Ye Ediyarade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Nditọ ete mi, udọñ esit mi ye akam mi ke iso Abasi edi nte Isrel ekpebọde edinyaña. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ami mmekeme ndidi ntiense nnọ mmọ ke ifiopesit ukpono Abasi emi mmọ enyenede, edi ifiopesit mmọ isañake ye ifiọk akpanikọ. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Mmọ idiọñọke usuñ emi Abasi adade anam mme owo enen ye Enye, mmọ edomo ndisiak usuñ idem mmọ anam mmọ inyimeke ndisuhọrede idem mmọ nnọ usuñ emi Abasi anamde mme owo enen. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Koro Kraist ama ada ibet ekesim utit man otodo owo ekededi emi enimde ke akpanikọ, ekpenam enye enen ye Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Emi edi se Moses ekewetde abaña owo ndinen ye Abasi nto ke edinim ibet ete: “Owo ekededi emi anamde se ibet etemede, edida oro idu uwem.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Edi emi edi se etiñde ebaña owo ndinen ye Abasi nto ke mbuọtidem: “Kudọhọ ke esit fo ete, Anie edidọk ika ikoduk ke Enyọñ?” (Oro edi ndisuhọde Kraist itie). <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Kunyuñ udọhọ ete, “Anie edisuhọde iduk ke ererimbot idak isọñ?” (Oro edi ndida Kraist nto ke ñkpa ñwọrọ ndi).<verse eid="ROM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Se enye etiñde edi emi: “Ikọ Abasi ekpere fi, ke inua fo ye ke esit fo,” enye oro edi ikọ mbuọtidem emi ñnyin ikwọrọde. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Edieke afo adade inua fo ọdọhọ ete, “Jisọs edi Ọbọñ,” onyuñ enim ke akpanikọ ke esit fo ete ke Abasi ama anam Enye eset, afo eyebọhọ. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Koro ñnyin inim ke akpanikọ ke esit ñnyin, ndien enam ñnyin inen ye Abasi; inyuñ ida inua ñnyin itiñ, ibọ edinyaña. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Koro ñwed Abasi ọdọhọ ete, “Owo ekededi emi ọbuọtde idem ye Enye idikwe but.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Enye emi edi ñkpọ kpukpru owo, koro ukpuhọde iduhọ ke ufọt mme Ju ye mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju. Abasi kiet edi Ọbọñ kpukpru owo, onyuñ eneñede ọdiọñ kpukpru mmọ emi ekotde Enye. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Kpa nte Ñwed Abasi ọdọhọde ete, “Owo ekededi emi esemede okot enyiñ Jihofa eyebọhọ.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Mmọ ekemedidie ndikot Enye emi mmọ minimke ke akpanikọ? Ndien mmọ ekemedidie ndinim Enye emi mmọ akananam mikopke ibaña ke akpanikọ? Ndien mmọ edisaña didie ikop kini emi owo mikwọrọke inọ mmọ? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Ọkwọrọ ikọ edikeme didie ndikwọrọ edieke owo midọñke enye aka? Kpa nte ñwed Abasi etiñde ete, “Ikpat mme mmọ emi edade eti mbuk edi eye didie!”<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Edi idighe kpukpru mmọ ekenyime ndibọ Eti Mbuk emi. Aisaya ke idem esie etiñ ete, “Ọbọñ anie edinim etop ñnyin ke akpanikọ?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Mmọdo mbuọtidem oto ke edikop etop Eti Mbuk, etop eti mbuk oto ke edikwọrọ Kraist.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Edi ami ñyom ndibup mbufo mbume nte, mme nte edi akpanikọ nte mmọ ikikopke etop Eti Mbuk? Ke akpanikọ, mmọ ema ekop, nte ñwed Abasi etiñde ete, “Uyom mme uyo mmọ ama ọwọrọ esim ofuri ekondo, ikọ mmọ onyuñ esim utit ererimbot.” <verse eid="ROM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Mfiak ntọñọ ntak mbup nte: Nte nditọ Isrel ikọdiọñọke ibaña? Moses ke idem esie edi akpa owo ndibọrọ mbume emi, “Ami ñyenam mbufo efibe mme mmọ emi midighe ata idut, ñyenyuñ nnam mbufo eyat esit ye idut emi edide mme ndisime.” <verse eid="ROM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Ndien Aisaya onyuñ etiñ ukouko, ete, “Mme mmọ emi mikoyomke mi ema ekut Mi; Ami ñkayarade idem mi nnọ mmọ emi mikebupke ibaña mi.” <verse eid="ROM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Edi kabaña Isrel, Enye ọdọhọ ete, “Ma nyanarede ubọk mi ke ofuri usen nnọ mbon nsọñibuot ye mme mbon ndutime.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Abasi Isinke Ikọt Esie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ami mbup ndien ntem nte, mme Abasi esin ikọt Esie? Idighe ntre. Ami ke idem mi ndi eyen Isrel, nto ke ubon Ebraham, ye ekpuk Benjamin.<verse eid="ROM 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Abasi isinke ikọt Esie emi Enye ekemekde toto ke editọñọ. Mbufo emefiọk se ñwed Abasi etiñde abaña Elaiya, nte enye ọkọtọtde nditọ Isrel ọnọ Abasi kabaña ido uwem mmọ? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Ete, “Ọbọñ, mmọ ewot mme Asiak Uduak Fo, enyuñ ewuri mme itie uwa fo, edi ami ikpọñ nsuhọ, mmọ ke enyuñ eñwana ndiwot mi.”<verse eid="ROM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Nso uto ibọrọ ke Abasi ọkọnọ enye? “Ami mọsuhọ tọsin owo itiaba nnim nnọ idem mi, mme mmọ emi mituakke ibuot inọ abasi Baal emi edide abasi nsu.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Anam kpa ke ukem usuñ oro, enyene esisit ibat owo emi Abasi emekde mfin emi, oto ke mbọm Esie. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Edimek Esie ebe ke mbọm Esie, itoho ke se mmọ enamde, koro edieke edimek emi Abasi emekde owo okpotode ke se owo anamde, ọwọrọ mbọm Esie ikpedighe aba ata nnen nnen mbọm.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Nso ndien? Nditọ Isrel ikekwe se mmọ ekeyomde. Ekedi ekpri otu owo emi Abasi emekde ekekut, utọñ mme mmọ eken ekesuhọde ema edọñọ inan enọ ikọ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Nte ñwed Abasi etiñde ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Abasi ama anam esit mmọ ye ekikere mmọ ebit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">tutu esim mfin emi mmọ ikemeke ndikut usuñ ke enyin mmọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">mme ndikop ikọ ke utọñ mmọ.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Defid onyuñ ọdọhọ ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Yak emum mmọ enyuñ eyiri mmọ ke afia ke itie usọrọ mmọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">yak mmọ eduọñọ, yak mmọ enyuñ ebọ ufen.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Yak enyin mmọ ekim, man mmọ ekukut usuñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">ndien enam mmọ enuhọ ke idak afanikọñ mmọ kpukpru ini.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ami mọtọñọ ntak mbup: nte mmọ eketuak ukot, man mmọ eduọ, nte mmọ midikemeke aba ndidaha nda? Baba-o, idighe ntre, akakam edi ke ntak idiọkñkpọ mmọ, anam edinyaña edi ebine mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju, man enam mme Ju efibe. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Edi idiọkñkpọ mme Ju ama ada ata ekese edidiọñ ọsọk ererimbot, unana mmọ ke Spirit onyuñ ada ata ekese edidiọñ ọsọk mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju. Edidiọñ edikpon adaña didie kini edidade mme Ju ekem ibat idian!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Ami ntiñ ikọ idahaemi ye mbufo mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju adaña ini nte ami ndide Ọbọsuru nnọ mmọ emi midighe mme Ju, ami ñyetiñ ase ke utom mi, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />mme ñyekeme ndinam mme mmọ emi edide oruk mi enyene ufup man ñnyuñ ñkeme ndinyaña ndusuk mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Koro ke ini ekesinde mmọ, ema enam ererimbot ufan ye Abasi. Editie didie ndien ke ini edifiakde ida mmọ? Edidi uwem ọnọ mme akpañkpa. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Edieke ubak ñkañ kiet uyo emi ewade nte akpa mbuñwum mfri asanade, ofuri ebok uyo asana kpasuk ntre; edieke oruñ eto asanade, mme ñkọk ñko enyuñ esana.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Ema ewak ndusuk ñkọk emi odude ke eto ata ọlif efep, enyuñ emen ñkọk eto ọlif ikọt eyiri ke eto ata ọlif. Mbufo mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju, etie nte eto ọlif ikọt ndien ke emi mbufo emenyene ebuana ke nsọñidem ye ata uwem emi edide eke mme Ju.<verse eid="ROM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Ke ntre, mbufo inyeneke ndisin mme mmọ oro esibede nte ñkọk efep ke ndek. Ekeme didie nditañ idem? Ke ini afo edide ñkọk, idighe afo omum oruñ akama, edi, oruñ omum fi akama.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Edi afo eyedọhọ ete, “Ekesibe mme ñkọk oro esio man enọ mi ifet,” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Emi edi akpanikọ. Ekesibe mmọ mme Ju esio koro mmọ mikenimke Abasi ke akpanikọ, ndien mbufo edu do koro mbufo enimde Abasi ke akpanikọ. Ekutañ idem, edi esuhọde idem, enyene esit ekọm enyuñ etiñ enyin. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Abasi ikefenke mme Ju emi eketiede nte mme ata ñkọk; mbufo ekere ndien ete ke enye eyefen mbufo?<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasi Enim Mme Eñwọñọ Esie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Mi ndien ke ñnyin ikut nte Abasi ọfọnde ido, ye nte Abasi ọsọñde ido. Enye ọsọñ ido ye mme mmọ emi eduọde, edi ọfọn ido ye mbufo edieke mbufo ekade iso emum mfọnido Esie ekama. Ke midighe ntre eyesibe mbufo ñko efep. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ama edi mme Ju, edieke mmọ ekpọñde unana mbuọtidem mmọ, eyefiak emen mmọ edian ke ebiet emi ekewakde mmọ esio koro Abasi ekeme nditọñọ ntak mmen mmọ ndian ke itie mmọ.<verse eid="ROM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Mbufo mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju etie nte ñkọk eto sokoro ikọt emi ekesibede esio, emi midighe ata sokoro, ndien emen edian ke eto ata sokoro, mme Ju etie nte ata eto sokoro, ndien edidi ata mmemmem ñkpọ Abasi ndimen mme ñkọk eto oro ekesibede mfep, mfiak ndian ke eto emi mmọ eketode.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Nditọ ete mi, enyene ndedibe akpanikọ emi ñyomde mbufo efiọk ebaña. Emi eyenam mbufo etre ndikere ete ke mmimọ imifiọk ñkpọ eti eti. Edi ntem: Isrel idisọñke ibuot ke nsinsi, edi eyebighi tutu ibat mme mmọ emi midighe Ju edi etiene Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ndien emi edi nte edisañade inyaña ofuri Isrel. Nte ñwed Abasi etiñde, ete, “Andinyaña eyeto ke Sayọn edi, Enye eyesio kpukpru idiọk ido ke ubon Jekọb efep.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Ami ñyenam ediomi emi ye mmọ, ke mma mbọ mmọ mme idiọkñkpọ.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Oto koro mmọ esinde Eti Mbuk emi, mme Ju edi asua ye Abasi oto ke ntak mbufo mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju. Edi ke ntak edimek emi Abasi ekemekde mmọ, mmọ edi mme ufan Esie ke ntak mme ete ete mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Abasi ikemeke nditọñọ ntak mbọ mme enọ ye ikọt Esie; mme Enye ndifiak edem ke mme eñwọñọ Esie. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ama edi mbufo mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju, mbufo ema esọñ ibuot ye Abasi ke ini emi ekebede, edi idaha emi mbufo emebọ mbọm Abasi koro mme Ju ekesọñde ibuot. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ke ukem usuñ oro, idahaemi mme Ju esọñ ibuot ye Abasi oto ke ntak mbọm emi mbufo ekebọde, man oto do mmọ ñko ebọ mbọm Abasi idahaemi. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Koro Abasi ama anam kpukpru owo eduk ufin nsọñibuot, man otodo Enye atua ofuri ubon owo mbọm.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Inyene Abasi awak didie, ọniọñ ye ifiọk Esie ọtuñọ didie! Anie ekeme nditim ntiñ se Enye ama ekebiere? Anie ekeme ndifiọk usuñ Esie? <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Nte ñwed Abasi ọdọhọde ete, “Anie owo ọdiọñọ ekikere Ọbọñ? Anie owo ekeme ndinọ Enye item?” <verse eid="ROM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />“Anie owo edi owo emi akananam ọnọde Abasi ñkpọ ndomokiet? Man oto ke oro Abasi ọkpọnọ enye usiene?” <verse eid="ROM 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Koro edi Enye okobot kpukpru ñkpọ ndien kpukpru ñkpọ edu uwem eto Enye, enyuñ enyene Enye. Ubọñ enyene Abasi ke nsinsi! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Edida Mme Enọ Emi Abasi Ọnọde Nsin Ke Edinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ke ntre nditọ ete mi, ami mmada mbọm Abasi ñkpe mbufo ubọk nte, eyak idem mbufo enọ Abasi nte odu uwem uwa, ke ndiyak idem mbufo nnọ ke utom esie ke edisana usuñ emi enemde enye esit. Emi edi nnen nnen ntuak ibuot emi mbufo enyenede ndinọ Enye. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ekunam ñkpọ ke edu uwem mbufo nte asañade akababa ye edu uwem mbon ererimbot emi midiọñọke Abasi, edi eyak Abasi ọkpuhọde mbufo oto esit esit ke edikabade esit mbufo ofuri ofuri. Ke ntre ke mbufo edikeme ndifiọk uduak Abasi, se ifọnde ye se inemde Enye esit, ye se ifọnde ima.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Ndien ke ntak utibe enọ emi Abasi ọnọde mi, ami ndọhọ kpukpru mbufo nte: Ekukut idem mbufo ekan nte ekpedide. Edi ekam enyene mfarakeidem nte asañade ekekem ye udomo mbuọtidem emi Abasi ọnọde mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Ñnyin imenyene ediwak ndido ke ikpọkidem ñnyin, ndien kpukpru ndido emi enyene nsio nsio utom ndinam. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Kpasuk ntre, okposuk edi emi ñnyin iwakde, ñnyin idi idem kiet ke ebuana ye Kraist ndien edian kpukpru ñnyin ebiet kiet nte asaña asaña mbak ke idem kiet.<verse eid="ROM 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Do ñnyin inyene ndida nsio nsio enọ ñnyin nsin ke edinam nte asañade ekekem ye mfọn emi Abasi ọnọde ñnyin. Edieke enọ owo kiet edide edisiak uduak Abasi, yak enye ada esin ke edinam ke idaha mbuọtidem esie. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Edieke edide edinam ñkpọ, yak enye anam ñkpọ; edieke edide edikpep ñkpọ, yak enye ekpep ñkpọ; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />edieke edide ndidọñ owo efen esit, yak enye ọdọñ esit; edieke edide ndinọ mme mmọ efen se inanade mmọ, yak enye ọnọ ke ntatubọk; edieke edide ndida usuñ yak enye ada ye ntiñ enyin; edieke edide editua owo mbọm, yak enye anam ke idara.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Ima enyene ndidi ke akpanikọ. Esua se idiọkde edi esọñọ emum se ifọnde ekama. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Ema kiet eken ye ufiop ufiop ima nte nditọ ete ke Kraist. Kpono kiet eken kan nte ekponode idem mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Sin ifik nam utom, kudi ifu. Nam ñkpọ nọ Abasi ke ufiop ufiop spirit ukpono ye ifik.<verse eid="ROM 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Eyak idorenyin mbufo anam mbufo edu ke idara, enyene ime ke ukut mbufo, ndien ebọñ akam kpukpru ini. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ebuana inyene mbufo ye mme nditọ ete mbufo emi enanade, enyuñ ekpep ndifọn ido ye mme isenowo.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Ebeñe Abasi ọdiọñ mme mmọ emi ekọbọde mbufo, ebeñe Enye ọdọdiọñ, ekusuñi mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Edara ye mme mmọ emi edarade, enyuñ efuhọ ye mme mmọ emi efuhọde. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Eda idem mbufo ukem ukem, ekutañ idem, edi ebeñe idem ndibuaha ye mbon usuhọde itie. Ekubat idem mbufo nte imọfiọk kpukpru ñkpọ.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Edieke owo anamde fi idiọkñkpọ kuda idiọk usio enye usiene. Ñwana ndinam se ifọnde ke enyin kpukpru owo. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Nam kpukpru se afo ekekeme ke ñkañ fo ndidu ke emem ye kpukpru owo.<verse eid="ROM 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Mme ufan mi, ekusio owo usiene, edi ekam eyak iyaresit Abasi anam emi ọnọ mbufo. Koro ikọ Abasi ọdọhọde ete, “Ọbọñ ọdọhọ ete: edi Ami nyene ndisio usiene, Ami ñyesio usiene.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Utu koro, nte ñwed Abasi etiñde, ete, “Edieke owo usua fo okopde biọñ, nọ enye udia; edieke itọñ asatde enye, nọ enye mmọñ ọñwọñ; koro ke edinam ntem afo eyewobi mbubek ikañ odori enye ke ibuot.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Ekuyak idiọkñkpọ akan mbufo, utu koro, eda nti ido ekan idiọkñkpọ.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ikọt Abasi Enyene Ndidi Mme Anam Akpanikọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kpukpru owo enyene ndisuk ibuot mmọ nnọ ukara, koro ukara ndomokiet iduhọ ke mibọhọke oto ke edinyime Abasi. Ndien mme ukara emi edude edi Abasi enim mmọ do. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Owo ekededi emi ọsọñde ibuot ye ukara emi odude, ọsọñ ibuot ye se Abasi ekenimde; ndien owo ekededi emi anamde ntre eyeda ubiomikpe Abasi ọnọ idem esie. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Koro ikanaha nte mme anam eti ido ebak mme akara ukara, edi ana mme mmọ emi enamde idiọkñkpọ enyene ndikop ndik. Nte afo amama ndidu ke unana ndik ye mme akara ukara? Ke ntre, nam se ifọnde, ndien enye eyetoro fi. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Koro enye edi isuñutom Abasi emi anamde ñkpọ esin ke ufọn fo. Edi edieke afo anamde idiọkñkpọ, bak enye, koro enye enyene odudu ndimia owo ufen ke ofuri akpanikọ. Enye edi isuñutom Abasi emi akamade ufen ndimia mme mmọ emi edide mme anam idiọkñkpọ <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ke ntak emi ana mbufo esuk ibuot enọ ukara, idighe ke ntak ndik ufen ikpọñ, edi nte otode ke isọñ esit mbufo.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Emi ñko edi ntak emi mbufo ekpede utib enọ ukara, koro ukara enamde utom enọ Abasi kadaña emi mmọ eyakde ofuri ini mmọ enam mme utom ukara. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Ekpe ndien kpukpru se mbufo ekamade mmọ, edieke afo akamade isọn taksi, kpe taksi emi ekpede ke inyene, kpe; edieke edide ukpono, nnọ ukpono; edieke edide uku, nọ uku. <verse eid="ROM 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ekukama owo baba kiet isọn, ñkukure isọn emi mbufo ekpekamade owo edi ima ndima kiet eken. Owo ekededi emi amade owo nte enye, enim ibet. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Mme ibet emi, “Kusin efibe; kuwot owo; kuyip inọ; kusin esit ke ñkpọ owo,” kpukpru emi ye mme ibet eken ebọp mmọ esin ke ibet kiet emi, “Ma mbọhoiduñ fo nte amade idem fo.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Owo ekededi emi amade mbọhọiduñ esie ikemeke ndinam enye idiọkñkpọ. Ndima ima edi ndinim ofuri mbet.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Mbufo enyene ndinam emi, koro mbufo ediọñọde utọ ini emi ñnyin idude ke esit. Ini edikem emi mbufo enyenede ndidemede ke idap. Koro ini emi edinyañade ñnyin ekpere akan ini emi ñnyin ikenimde ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Okoneyo ekpere ndibe mma, usiere edidi ama. Eyak ñnyin itre ndinam mme ñkpọ emi enamde ke idak ekim, ndien imen mme ñkpọ ekọñ uñwana ibọbọ ke idem ñnyin. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Eyak ñnyin inam ñkpọ nte ọfọnde, nte mme mmọ emi edude ke uñwana usen; ukpammin okudu, use okudu, uwem esuene okudu, eñwan mme ufup okudu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Edi esine Ọbọñ Jisọs Kraist nte ọfọñidem ekọñ, ekukpañ utọñ enọ idiọk udọñ obukidem ndinam uduak esie.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ekusioño Kiet Eken Ndo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Edara owo emi mbuọtidem esie misọñke idem ke otu mbufo, edi ekuneni eneni ye enye ke mme ekikere esie. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Mbuọtidem owo kiet onyime enye adia kpukpru ñkpọ, edi enyemi mbuọtidem esie ememde, adia ikọñ ikpọñ. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Owo emi adiade ñkpọ kiet ekededi okusin enye emi midiaha ke ndek, kpa ntre ñko enyemi adiade ikọñ ikpọñ okukpe enyemi adiade kpukpru ñkpọ ikpe koro Abasi enyime kpukpru mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Afo edi anie emi ekemede ndikpe eyen ufọk owo efen ikpe? Edi eteufọk esie enyene ndibiere mme enye ọsọñọ ada mme enye ọduọ. Ndien enye eyesọñọ ada koro eteufọk esie ekeme ndinam enye ọsọñọ ada.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Owo kiet ekere ete ke usen kiet asana akan kpukpru mme usen eken, edi owo eken ekere ete ke kpukpru usen edi ukem ukem. Owo kiet kiet enyene nditim mbiere ke esit esie. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Enyemi ekerede ete ke usen kiet ọfọn akan mme usen eken anam ntre ke ntak Ọbọñ. Enye emi atade unam anam ntre ke ubọñ Abasi, koro enye ọnọde Abasi ekọm ke ntak udia oro. Owo ekededi emi esinde ndidia ñkpọ kiet ekededi anam ntre esin ke ubọñ Abasi, ndien enye onyuñ ọnọ Abasi ekọm. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Ñnyin ndomokiet iduhọ uwem inọ idem ñnyin ikpọñ. Ñnyin ndomokiet inyuñ ikpaha inọ idem ñnyin ikpọñ; <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />edieke ñnyin idude uwem ñnyin idu uwem inọ Ọbọñ, ndien edieke ñnyin ikpade ñnyin ikpa inọ Ọbọñ. Ke ntre mme ñnyin idu ke uwem mme ikpakpa, ñnyin idi inyene Ọbọñ. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Koro Kraist akakpa onyuñ eset ke ñkpa oduk ke uwem man enye ekpedi Ọbọñ mme odu uwem ye mme akpaña ñkpa.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Ndien ntak emi afo asuade ọnọ eyen ete fo-o? Ntaha afo esinde eyen ete fo ke ndek-e? Kpukpru ñnyin iyeda ke iso Abasi, man Enye ekpe ikpe ñnyin. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Koro ewet ete, “Ọbọñ ọdọhọ ete, adaña nte Ami ndude uwem, kpukpru edọñ eyetọñọ enọ Mi, ndien kpukpru edeme eyedọhọ ete ke Ami ndi Abasi.” <verse eid="ROM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Owo ñnyin kiet kiet, ndien, eyenam ibat idem esie ọnọ Abasi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ke ntre eyak ñnyin itre ndibiom kiet eken ikpe. Utu ke oro, eyak ñnyin ibiere nditre ndinam ñkpọ kiet ekededi emi edinamde eyen ete ñnyin ọduọ oduk idiọkñkpọ.<verse eid="ROM 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Ebuana mi ye Ọbọñ Jisọs anam mi ndiọñọ nte ke ñkpọ ndomokiet ideheke ke idem esie; edi edieke owo enimde ke akpanikọ ete ke ñkpọ ekededi edehe, ke ntre ñkpọ oro akabade edi ndedehe ọnọ enye. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Edieke afo esinde eyen ete fo ke ukut oto ke se afo adiade, oro owut ete ke afo unamke aba ñkpọ ye enye ke ima. Ekuyak udia emi mbufo ediade edi ñkpọ nsobo ọnọ owo emi Kraist akakpade ọnọ. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ekuyak mme owo etiñ idiọk ikọ edian se mbufo ekerede ete ke edi eti ñkpọ <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Koro Obio Ubọñ Abasi idighe mbubehe edidia ye ediñwọñ ñkpọ, edi, edi edisana ido, emem, ye idara ke Edisana Spirit. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Ndien owo kiet ekededi emi anamde ñkpọ ọnọ Kraist ke utọ usuñ emi, enem Abasi esit, mme owo enyuñ ekpono enye. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ke ntre, eyak ñnyin isin ifik inam ñkpọ emi adade emem edi ye ñkpọ emi ediñwamde kiet eken ndikọri.<verse eid="ROM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Kubiat utom Abasi oto ke ntak udia. Ekeme ndidia kpukpru oruk udia, edi, edi idiọkñkpọ ndidia ñkpọ kiet ekededi emi edinamde owo efen ọduọ oduk idiọkñkpọ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Nnen nnen ñkpọ ndinam edi nditre ndita unam, mme ndiñwọñ mmin, mme ndinam ñkpọ ekededi efen emi edinamde eyen ete fo ọduọ. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Ke ntre se ededi emi mbufo enimde ke akpanikọ ebaña mme ñkpọ emi, edip ke ufọt mbufo ye Abasi. Ọfọfọn ọnọ owo emi mibiomke idem esie ikpe oto ke se enye ọsọñọde nte ke ọfọn. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Edi owo ekededi emi enyenede eyighe abaña se enye adiade, oduk ke ubiomikpe edieke enye adiade udia oro, koro edidia esie itoho ke mbuọtidem; ndien ñkpọ kiet ekededi emi mitoho ke mbuọtidem, edi idiọkñkpọ.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Ñnyin emi isọñde idem ke mbuọtidem ikpenyene ndiñwam mbio mmemidem ekeme ndibiom mme mbiomo mmọ. Ñnyin ikunam ñkpọ ndinem idem ñnyin esit. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Utu koro, ñnyin kiet kiet ikpenyene ndinem mbọhọiduñ ñnyin esit ke ufọn esie man oto do ikeme ndinam enye ọkọri ke mbuọtidem. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Koro Kraist ikanamke inemesit inọ idem Esie. Utu koro kpa nte ñwed Abasi ewetde ete, “Mme emiom emi mme mmọ oro emiomde mbufo odoro mi ke idem.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Kpukpru se ewetde ke ñwed Abasi ekewet ndida ñkpep ñnyin ñkpọ, man otodo ñnyin ikpedori enyin ito ime ye idọñesit emi ikọ Abasi ọnọde ñnyin.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Yak Abasi emi ọnọde ime ye idọñesit ọnọ mbufo spirit edidiana kiet ke otu mbufo nte mbufo etienede nti uwutñkpọ Kraist, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />man otodo ke esit kiet ye uyo kiet mbufo ekpenọ Abasi ye Ete Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist ubọñ.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Mmọ Emi Midighe Mme Ju Ekeme Ndidara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Edara kiet eken kpa nte Kraist akadarade mbufo, man mbufo eda itoro enọ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Koro ami ndọhọ mbufo nte ke Kraist ekedi anam ñkpọ nnọ mme Ju man enye owut ete ke edi anam akpanikọ, onyuñ anam mme eñwọñọ emi Enye ọkọñwọñọde ọnọ mme ete ete osu, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />ndien ñko, man Enye ọnọ mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju ukeme nditoro Abasi ke mbọm Esie, nte ikọ Abasi ọdọhọde, ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ke ntak emi ami ñyetoro Fi ke otu mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">ñyekwọ ikwọ itoro nnọ Enyiñ Fo.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Onyuñ ọtọñọ ntak ọdọhọ ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Edara, mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">ye mme idut emi Abasi emekde.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Ndien ñko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Etoro Abasi kpukpru mbufo mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">etoro Enye kpukpru mbufo mme idut.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ndien ñko, Aisaya ọdọhọ ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Kiet ke ubon Jesi eyedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">eyemenede enye enim ndikara mme kpukpru mme idut,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ndien mmọ eyedori enyin ke enye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Yak Abasi emi edide oruñ idorenyin, ọyọhọ mbufo ye kpukpru idara ye emem ke ntak mbuọtidem emi mbufo enyenede ke Enye, man otode idorenyin mbufo akpaka iso ndikọri ke odudu Edisana Spirit.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Mme nditọ ete mi, ami ke idem mi mọyuhọ nte ke mbufo emeyọhọ ye nti ido, emeyọhọ ye kpukpru ifiọk, ndien mbufo emekeme ndikpep kiet eken. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Edi ke ñwed mi emi, ami mmewet mbufo uko uko mbaña mme ñkpọ ifañ emi ñkpetide mbufo ini kiet efen. Ami ñnyene uko oto ke mfọn emi Abasi ọkọnọde mi, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />ndidi asañautom Kraist Jisọs, ke otu mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju, ye utom mme oku ke ndikwọrọ Eti Mbuk Obio Ubọñ Abasi, man otodo mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju ekpekabade edi mme enọ emi Abasi edibọde, emi Edisana Spirit anamde esana. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ke ntem, ke edidiana kiet ye Kraist Jisọs, ami mmekeme ndien nditañ idem ke utom emi ami namde nnọ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Ami ndinyene uko nditiñ mbaña se Kraist ebede ke ubọk mi anam ke edinam mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju esuk ibuot enọ Abasi oto ke ikọ ye edinam mi, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />ke odudu emi asañade ye mme utibe ñkpọ, adiana ye odudu Spirit. Do ndien, ke edisaña nto Jerusalem ñka Ilirikọm, ami ñkwọrọ ofuri ofuri Eti Mbuk emi abañade Kraist.<verse eid="ROM 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Udọñ esit mi kpukpru ini ekedi ndikwọrọ Eti Etop emi ke mme ebiet emi owo mikekopke kaña ibaña Kraist, man ami ndibọp ndori ke itiat idak isọñ emi owo efen ekesinde. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Nte ikọ Abasi etiñde, ete, “Mme mmọ emi owo miketiñke inọ mmọ ibaña Enye eyekut, ndien mme mmọ emi mikopke, eyeñwaña mmọ.” <verse eid="ROM 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ke ntak emi ke ekebiọñọ mi ediwak ini ndidi ndise mbufo.<verse eid="ROM 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Edi idahaemi ami mma ñkekure utom mi ke ñkanñkuk emi, ñko sia ekedide udọñ mi ke ata anyan isua ndikut mbufo, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ami menyene idorenyin ndinam ntre idahaemi. Ami ñkpama ndikut mbufo ke usuñ isañ mi ndika obio Sipen, man mbọ uñwam nto mbufo ke ndika do, ke mma ñkedara ye mbufo ke esisit ini.<verse eid="ROM 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ediñwam Ikọt Abasi Ke Ini Unana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Idahaemi, nte ededi, ami ñyom ndika Jerusalem ke ntak utom ikọt Abasi do ñko. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Koro mme ufọk Abasi ke Masidonia ye Kris ema ebiere ke idara ndinọ mme enọ ndida ññwam mbon unana ke otu ikọt Abasi ke Jerusalem. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Mmọ ke idem mmọ ekebiere ndinam emi. Edi ke ata akpanikọ mmọ enyene mfighe ke esit mmọ ndiñwam mme mbon unana oro; mme Ju ekebuana mme edidiọñ mmọ ke ñkpọ spirit ye mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju, ndien mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju ñko ekpenyene ndinam ñkpọ nnọ mme Ju ke ndibuana edidiọñ nti ñkpọ uwem emi ye mmọ <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ke ini ami mmannam utom emi mma, ndien ñnyuñ ñyak kpukpru okuk emi ekenọde mi nnọ mmọ, ami ñyekpọñ mmọ ñka Sipen ndien ñyewaha nse mbufo mbemiso ami mbe. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ke ini ndidide ndise mbufo, ami mmọfiọk nte ke ami ndidi ye ọyọhọ udomo edidiọñ emi otode Kraist.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ami mmekpe ye mbufo nditọ ete, ke ntak Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist ye ke ima emi Spirit ọnọde; ebuana ye ami ke ndibọñ akam eti eti nnọ Abasi mbaña mi. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ebọñ akam ete yak Abasi anyaña mi osio ke ubọk mme mmọ emi minimke ke akpanikọ ke Judia, ñko yak utom mi ke Jerusalem edi se ikọt Abasi do edidarade. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ndien, ke ntre ami ñyedi ndise mbufo ye ọyọhọ idara, edieke edide uduak Abasi, ndien mbọ nduọkodudu ke ifure ye mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Yak emem Abasi odu ye kpukpru mbufo. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọm Kiet Eken</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ami nda eyen ete ñnyin añwan Fibe ñwut mbufo, emi anamde ñkpọ ọnọ Abasi ke ufọk Abasi ke Senkras. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Edara enye ke enyiñ Ọbọñ nte odotde ye ikọt Abasi, enyuñ enọ enye uñwam ekededi emi enye oyomde oto mbufo; koro enye ke idem esie edide eti ufan ọnọ ediwak owo kpa ye ami nde. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ami mọnọ ekọm esọk Brisila ye Akwila, mme nsaña utom mi ke iñwañ utom Kraist Jisọs, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />emi ekenyimede ndiwa uwem mmọ ke ntak mi. Ami madara ke edinam mmọ ye ami, inyuñ idighe ami ikpọñ, mme ufọk Abasi emi edude ke otu mme mmọ emi midighe mme Ju ediana do ñko.<verse eid="ROM 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Ekọm ufọk Abasi emi esobode ke ufọk mmọ. Ekọm edima ufan mi Epinetọs emi ekedide akpa owo ke ñkanñkuk Esia nditiene Kraist. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Ekọm Meri emi akanamde ọkpọsọñ utom ọnọ mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Ekọm Andrọnikọs ye Junia nditọ ete Ju emi ekedude ke ufọk ñkpọkọbi ye ami. Mme Ọbọsuru etim ediọñọ mmọ, mmọ ñko ekebem mi iso edi nditọ Abasi. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Enọ Ampliatọs ekọm mi, edima ufan mi ke Ọbọñ. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ekọm Ọrbanọs, nsaña utom ñnyin ke Kraist, ye Stakis, edima ufan mi.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ekọm Apele emi ema ekedomo akpanikọ esie ye Kraist ese. Ekọm kpukpru mme mmọ oro etode ufọk Aristobulọs. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Ekọm Erodiọn, Ju nte ami, ye mme nditọ ete emi edide mme ikọt Abasi ke ufọk Nasisọs. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ekọm Trifina ye Trifosa, emi esinde ifik ke utom Abasi, ye edima ufan mi Persis emi anamde nti utom ọnọ Ọbọñ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Ekọm Rufọs owo emi etop esie ọwọrọde ada asaña asaña ke utom Abasi ye eka esie, emi akadade mi onyuñ anam ñkpọ ye ami nte eyen esie. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ekọm Asinkritọs, Flekọn, Ermis Batrọbas, Ermas, ye kpukpru mme ikọt Abasi eken emi edude ye mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ekọm Filolokọs ye Julia ye Neriọs ye eyen eka esie añwan, ye Olimpas ye ofuri ikọt Abasi emi edude ye mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ekọm kiet eken ye ntiminua nditọ eka, kpukpru mme ufọk Abasi Kraist enọ ekọm mmọ esọk mbufo.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Ami mme kpe ye mbufo, nditọ ete mi, ekpeme mmọ oro etọde ubahade, enyuñ etimerede mbuọtidem mme owo, enyuñ etuahade ye ukpepñkpọ emi mbufo ekebọde. Eda nsan nsan ye mmọ. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Koro mme mmọ emi; enamde mme uduot ñkpọ ntem inamke ñkpọ inọ Kraist Ọbọñ ñnyin, edi enam enọ idibi mmọ, Mmọ eda inem ikọ inua ye mme ikọ abiaña ewọñọde esit mme mmọ emi miduehe isop. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kpukpru owo ekop ebaña iwuk mbufo ke Eti Etop Uwọrọ ufin emi, ndien ke ntak emi esit enem mi ye mbufo. Ami ñyom mbufo edi mme enyene ibuot owo ebaña se ifọnde, edi enana ndo ke se, idiọkde. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Ndien Abasi emi edide oruñ emem ñnyin, eyesọhi Setan ke idak ikpat mbufo idibighike. Yak mfọn Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist odu ye mbufo.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti, edima nsaña utom mi, ọnọ ekọm esọk mbufo, kpa ntre Lusiọs, Jesin, ye Sosipata emi edide; Ju nsaña ñnyin. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Ami Tetiọs, andiwet ñwed emi mmọnọ ekọm ikọt Abasi esọk mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Enye emi ami nduñde ke ufọk esie, Keyọs emi ufọk Abasi esobode ke ufọk esie ọnọ ekọm esọk mbufo. Erastọs, akama okuk obio ye eyen ete ñnyin Kwatọs, enọ ekọm esọk mbufo. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Yak mfọn Ọbọñ ñnyin Jisọs Kraist odu ye kpukpru mbufo. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Eyak ñnyin inọ Abasi ubọñ. Enye ekeme ndinam mbufo esọñọ eda ke mbuọtidem mbufo nte asañade ekekem ye Eti mbuk emi ami ñkwọrọde, etop emi abañade Jisọs Kraist, ye nte asañade ekekem ye ediyarade ndedibe akpanikọ emi ekedibede ke ata anyan emana emi ekebede. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Idahaemi nte ededi, emen akpanikọ oro eyarade añwa añwa oto ke se mme prọfet ekewetde, emi otode ke uyo Ndodu Abasi, ema enam kpukpru idut ediọñọ ebaña; man otodo kpukpru owo ekpenim ke akpanikọ enyuñ esuk ibuot enọ Enye. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Yak ubọñ enyene Abasi Ete kierakiet, emi edide Enye ikpọñ ikpọñ ọfiọk kpukpru ñkpọ, ke Enyiñ Jisọs Kraist, ke nsinsi. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>